      "problem": "The row echelon form matrix $M$ is given below. What are the pivot columns of $M?$\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}5 & -6 & 8 & 7 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & 3 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 3 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
